message: >-
  If you use this software, cite it using the metadata below. If you use
  results or claims from the accompanying paper, cite the preferred
  citation instead.
title: NumaRing
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sinha
    given-names: Parth Kumar
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3120-9301"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Oxford, United Kingdom"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sinhaparth5/NumaRing"
